To balance between semaphore depletion and excessive resource consumption, the initial semaphore value is calculated based on the expected concurrency levels (Environment.ProcessorCount * 2).

The class uses a hashcode to generate integers in a scalable way, minimizing contention when generating multiple integer values close together. The resulting hashcode is also logged for troubleshooting purposes.

Finally, appropriate error handling and logging are implemented using Debug.WriteLine() to facilitate troubleshooting in production environments. This code can be easily integrated into an existing application without introducing significant latency or resource overhead.']

