For better performance under varying load conditions, consider using a task queue like Kue or Bun to manage command execution efficiently and improve fault tolerance. Additionally, you might want to explore libraries like cross-spawn for handling shell commands more easily across different environments. Keep in mind that further optimizations may be necessary depending on your specific use case and performance requirements.']

