The implementation is designed to balance memory usage, processing speed, and handling a high volume of tasks while considering scalability for increased load. The error-handling mechanism manages memory allocation failures and frees all resources upon completion. However, you'll need to implement the serialization/deserialization functions and performance optimizations according to your specific requirements.']

