    num_items = 1000  # Initialize a collection of this many items
    min_val, max_val = 0, 100  # Specify the range for randomly generating values

    init_collection(num_items, min_val, max_val)

    md5_hashes = traverse_directory(root_dir, size_threshold)
    print(md5_hashes)
```

