To improve performance, consider implementing an efficient iterator for processing the file line by line, utilizing caching strategies for frequently accessed random values, optimizing hash calculation process, integrating logging to monitor performance metrics, and adjusting logging levels dynamically during runtime. Also, ensure proper error handling and validation when reading integers from standard input.']

